# Semgrep's built-in ignore list skips test/, tests/, testsuite/ and *_test.go.
# This repository keeps security-relevant Rust setup in tests/, so the test
# trees must stay in scope. Declaring this file replaces that built-in list.
#
# Keep generated, vendored, and local-only trees out instead. SOP also passes
# its configured security.exclude patterns as --exclude; these entries keep a
# manual `semgrep scan` in this repository consistent with the SOP scan.
target/
node_modules/
web/.next/
web/.next-build/
data/
.run/
.worktrees/
.agent-sdlc/
